              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ઊંઘમાં બાળકના મોઢામાંથી લાળ પડે છે. ū̃ghmā̃ bāḷaknā moḍhāmā̃thī lāḷ paḍe che. The baby drools in its sleep."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A feminine noun."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "લાળ (lāḷ) is inherited from Sanskrit lālā, \"spittle, saliva\"; CDIAL lists the Gujarati word (CDIAL 11027)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
